# NVIDIA Sans is PROPRIETARY — never commit its font files anywhere. The
# air-gapped story for NVIDIA Sans is the metric-matched "NVIDIA Sans Fallback"
# (local()-only, no binary). JetBrains Mono (open, SIL OFL 1.1) IS committed
# under public/fonts/jetbrains-mono/ with its OFL.txt.
public/fonts/nvidia-sans/**
src/fonts/NVIDIASans*
src/fonts/NVIDIA*

